   \[
   a = \frac{F}{m} = \frac{8.00 \times 10^{-17} \, \text{N}}{1.67 \times 10^{-27} \, \text{kg}} = 4.79 \times 10^{10} \, \text{m/s}^2
   \]  
   The magnitude of the acceleration is \(\boxed{4.79 \times 10^{10} \, \text{m/s}^2}\).  

(b) To find the time taken to reach \(35,000 \, \text{m/s}\):  
